 "sources": [
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000bb9",
   "title": "Call with Tidepool, week 41",
   "text": "Priya: Thanks for making time. We have been on the product for about four months now.\nPriya: We would really like an audit log so we can see who changed a request's status. Right now nobody can tell, and it has caused a couple of awkward conversations.\nTom: SSO again, honestly. It is the first thing our admin asks about every time we add a new teammate.\nPriya: The cited quotes are the best part. Nothing else shows me where an idea came from.\nTom: One more thing, the weekly digest sent me the same email twice on Monday. That looked like a bug.\n",
   "personId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000007d1",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-26T12:00:00Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000bba",
   "title": "Support chat, Brightlane",
   "text": "Sam: Hi, quick question. How do I invite someone who only needs to read?\nSam: Our CFO wants to look at the roadmap but I do not want her changing anything.\nAgent: Right now every invited person can edit. I will pass this on.\nSam: Thanks. Also, is there any way to export the request list to a spreadsheet? I keep copying it by hand for our monthly review.\n",
   "personId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000007d3",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-23T12:00:00Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000bbb",
   "title": "Renewal call, Harbor & Pine",
   "text": "Maya: We are happy overall and we plan to renew. Two things would make it an easy yes for my boss.\nMaya: We need single sign-on with our identity provider. Our security team will not approve a new tool that has separate passwords.\nDiego: And a mobile app would help. I read feedback on the train and the website is hard to use on my phone.\nMaya: If you could also tell customers when something they asked for ships, that would save us a lot of manual emailing.\n",
   "personId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000007d4",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-20T12:00:00Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000bbc",
   "title": "Email from Copperfield",
   "text": "Hannah: Hello, I love the new look but I work late and the bright screen is tiring. Is there a dark mode?\nHannah: The weekly digest also arrived twice for me last Monday. Is that expected?\nHannah: Otherwise everything works well for our small team.\n",
   "personId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000007d6",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-17T12:00:00Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000bbd",
   "title": "Interview notes, Harbor & Pine admin",
   "text": "Diego: When we onboarded forty people it took an afternoon to add them one by one. Importing from a spreadsheet would have saved us hours.\nDiego: I also want to know who accepted each suggestion. An audit log would settle arguments about what changed.\nDiego: The roadmap page is useful for customers. Please keep it simple.\n",
   "personId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000007d5",
   "createdAt": "2026-10-14T12:00:00Z"
  }
 ],
